# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AeroJEPA .gitignore
# Commit: source, configs, docs, small JSON metrics under results/
# Ignore: regenerated training artifacts, large binaries, local footage
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python bytecode / packaging
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
.env.*

# Test / tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Local / private notes (never publish; Desktop copies are fine)
AeroJEPA_Current_State.md
AeroJEPA_CURSOR*
AeroJEPA_physics_memo.md
*COLLAB_MEMO.md
docs/DEMO_VIDEO_BRIEF.md

# Scratch run logs under results/
results/_*.log

# Training artifacts (regenerated from configs + seeds)
checkpoints/
runs/
logs/
wandb/
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.pth
# Exported CPU release copies (local only; upload to Hugging Face, never commit)
released_weights/_export/
# Local TorchScript / ONNX of planning forward (see docs/EXPORT.md)
exports/*.ts
exports/*.onnx
exports/*_meta.json
exports/*.pt
# Large model weights: keep out of git; host on Hugging Face (see released_weights/).

# AeroProber ablation run logs (regenerated)
research/prober/results/_*.log

# Metrics JSON under results/ is small and tracked; ignore rendered previews.
results/synthetic_preview/
results/**/*.png
results/**/*.gif

# Raw datasets / footage (large, local). Ignore contents of top-level data/
# only — does NOT touch src/aerojepa/data/ (the Python source package).
/data/*
!/data/README.md

# Rendered figures (regenerate with scripts/visualize.py, compare_ablations.py)
visualizations/figures/**/*.png
visualizations/figures/**/*.pdf
visualizations/planner/**/*.gif
visualizations/planner/**/*.mp4

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Rust native crate build artifacts (optional accelerator)
native/**/target/
native/**/*.so
native/**/*.dylib
native/**/*.dll
